      "\n",
      "============================================================\n",
      "[TARGET] ADVERSARIAL DIAGNOSTIC RESULTS (V5.2 — Group Boundary)\n",
      "============================================================\n",
      "Standard Eval ROC-AUC :   0.5667\n",
      "Adversarial ROC-AUC   :   0.9939\n",
      "Adversarial Spearman  :   0.8514\n",
